TWEAK_NAME="Select Bluetooth audio first"
TWEAK_RISK="medium"
TWEAK_EXPERIMENTAL=1
TWEAK_DESCRIPTION="When a Bluetooth audio device reports itself as available (stock StatusMenuBTAudio message with appStatus Available and a device name), sends the stock SelectBTAudio event once per boot, so BT audio becomes the active source instead of the last used one. Appends a guarded wrapper of _StatusMenuBTAudioMsgHandler to /jci/gui/apps/system/js/systemApp.js; the stock body always runs first, and nothing is sent when no device name is reported."
